You had some great moves out there.

249
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:20,330
Thanks.

250
00:15:20,413 --> 00:15:21,907
You weren't so bad yourself.

251
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:25,897
That shield and sword switch
you pulled out there was great.

252
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:26,810
I'm serious.

253
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,637
One of the best I've ever seen.

254
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:31,073
Sorry I said some mean things about you.

255
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:33,960
It's all good, Shorty. Smell you later.

256
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:37,660
Thanks again for an awesome
duel, Wheeler. Sure.

257
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,197
And best of luck in the finals, all right?

258
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:43,057
I'll never forget that
sweet move you taught me.

259
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:45,880
Maybe I'll use it in
the finals. Thank you.

260
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,737
This is where it all ends, Yu-Gi.

261
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:54,820
There's no way you can escape the
devastation of my three blue eyes.

262
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,882
The moment I've been
waiting for is finally here!

263
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,140
Ha ha ha ha!

264
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,440
Ha ha ha ha!

265
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,400
I'm in major trouble!

266
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:05,577
With three blue eyes white dragons,

267
00:16:05,660 --> 00:16:09,777
Kaiba can easily wipe out both of my
monsters and the rest of my life points!

268
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:10,980
What am I gonna do?

269
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:15,400
It looks like the end of
the line for the Pharaoh.

270
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:20,440
Which means Seto Kaiba will be the
next casualty on the Shadow Realm.

271
00:16:20,820 --> 00:16:22,980
Now my three blue eyes, attack!

272
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:26,160
Finish him off and end this duel!

273
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:28,370
No!

274
00:16:31,980 --> 00:16:35,520
Once my dragons attack,
this duel is over, Yugi!

275
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,920
Hold on, Yugi.

276
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,270
Shall we?

277
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:42,300
Yep, the one and only, pal.

278
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:44,660
I'm about to lose this duel!

279
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,100
Guess again, Yugi.

280
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:47,697
It's like you always tell me.

281
00:16:47,780 --> 00:16:50,217
Look closely and consider
all of your options.

282
00:16:50,300 --> 00:16:51,520
All of my options?

283
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,230
Yep.

284
00:16:53,313 --> 00:16:55,347
I think you'll find a
card that can save you.

285
00:16:56,620 --> 00:16:57,450
Let's see.

286
00:16:57,533 --> 00:16:58,363
He's right!

287
00:16:58,540 --> 00:16:59,658
There's still hope!

288
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:05,780
Nice try, Yu-Gi, but you're no
longer the top-ranked duelist. What?

289
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,600
It's Red-Eyes Black Dragon!

290
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:11,180
Where did that come from?

291
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:12,460
If you recall,

292
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:16,617
you used your flute of summoning dragon
to summon your blue eyes to the field.

293
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:20,860
But you may have forgotten that
your flute works on my hand as well.

294
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:25,940
So I owe you a thank you
for bringing out this card,

295
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:29,494
which is a gift from a very
close friend of mine, Kaiba.

296
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:37,200
This doesn't change a thing, Yugi.

297
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:40,320
I can destroy you and your red eyes.

298
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:44,097
Kaiba, don't be so sure of that, you fool.

299
00:17:44,180 --> 00:17:49,660
Now, my blue-eyes white dragons will
destroy all three of your monsters!

300
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,340
Attack now!

301
00:17:53,020 --> 00:17:55,300
Annihilate his Dark Magician first!

302
00:17:58,200 --> 00:18:00,880
Say goodbye to your favorite monster!

303
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:02,980
Not so fast, Kaiba!

304
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,280
Activate Trap!

305
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,460
Magician selection?

306
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:10,237
That protects your Dark
Magician from my attack!

307
00:18:10,320 --> 00:18:13,760
Which means you and your
monster will escape unharmed!

308
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:15,356
That's right, Kaiba.

309
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:19,540
But my trap also sends your weakest
monster to the card graveyard.

310
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:25,760
Fine, but you'll never
escape my other two attacks.

311
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:33,120
Beta, the Magnet Warrior is
gone, and your Red Eyes is next.

312
00:18:33,420 --> 00:18:35,340
So much for Wheeler's gift.

313
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:37,186
That's what you think, Kaiba.

314
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,300
Reveal face-down card.

315
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:45,077
My Spellbinding Circle card
puts an end to your Blue

316
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:50,560
Eyes attack And lowers its
strength by 700 Nice try, Kaiba

317
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,260
Time for Red Eyes to fight back

318
00:18:55,280 --> 00:19:00,300
Destroy his Blue Eyes White
Dragon with Inferno Fire Blast

319
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:12,480
All right, you may have saved yourself
for now, but this duel's far from done.

320
00:19:14,860 --> 00:19:19,480
Well, it looks like I made it out of
that mess, and I owe it all to you, Joey.

321
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:23,214
All I did was remind you of
the advice that you gave me.

322
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:25,620
Now, win this fight, pal.

323
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:26,880
You too, Joey.

324
00:19:30,700 --> 00:19:31,860
Hey, guys, look!

325
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:33,980
He's waking up!

326
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:36,380
Are you okay, Joey?

327
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:45,840
I must admit, Yugi's
move took me by surprise.

328
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:50,280
But if he thinks this is the time
to celebrate, he's sadly mistaken.

329
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:52,160
Victory will be mine!

330
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:54,020
I have a long way to go,

331
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:58,257
but as long as I have faith in the
heart of the cards and in my friends,

332
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:00,060
I know I can win this!

333
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,700
Joey, say something!
